        "t": 472.32,
        "r": 289.66999999999985,
        "b": 414.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "The Air breaker assembly is mounted on the left side of the tub. Its purpose is to provide a method of supplying water for the wash and rinse cycles. The air gap prevents the siphoning of wash water from flowing back into the water supply system and prevents the water pressure from not dropping below atmospheric pressure.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1016",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_24",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_24",
